WEBVTT

00:03:59.179 --> 00:04:03.268
(Te qeshura)

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:09.532
Fitove? E kape? E kape? Shkelqyeshem!

00:04:09.532 --> 00:04:12.049
(Duartrokitje)

00:04:12.049 --> 00:04:15.591
Ju lumte. Faleminderit. Shume faleminderit.

00:04:15.591 --> 00:04:16.996
Ne rregull.

00:04:16.996 --> 00:04:20.408
Nderkohe qe ju lumturoheni

00:04:20.408 --> 00:04:22.210
qe keni fituar lojen tuaj te pare

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:23.825
te mundjes me gishta me shume lojtare,

00:04:23.825 --> 00:04:26.415
le te bejme nje permbledhje te shpejte te emocioneve pozitive.

00:04:26.415 --> 00:04:28.354
Pra kurioziteti.

00:04:28.354 --> 00:04:30.326
Une thashe "mundje gishtash me shume lojtare".